Some months later you receive a new letter...
-> greeting

=== greeting ===
Beloved Brother in Priesthood!

It is so obvious as to sound almost banal, but that does not make it less true: the Church could not go on without your dedication and pastoral service. So before all else, I would like to express my gratitude and appreciation for the generous work that you do each day.

In addition to this, your earlier work in the new lands has aided our missionaries. The Shrines are back to their prior state and this is the fruit of your labor. We are extatic to invite you to our great Capital in the upcoming year to celebrate this milestone and your hard work.

    -> END
